    end

    CODE_UC -->|"应用验证通过"| TEST

    subgraph SG_TEST["⑥ 测试工程师 test-engineer · deepseek-v4-pro"]
        direction TB
        TEST["GWT 验收测试<br/>06_TESTS/features/index.feature"]
